  startDialogueLines:
  - "Witch: Oh? You\u2019re back\u2026 and empty-handed\u2014\nexcept for that one
    letter."
  - 'Witch: So you delivered them all.

    I knew you would.'
  - "Witch: This last one\u2026 it\u2019s different.\nI didn\u2019t want you to open
    it alone."
  - "Witch: Come, apprentice.\nLet\u2019s open the final letter together."
